~ exploration
if 0 < Stats.faction_opinions.get("knights") and Stats.faction_opinions.get("knights") <= 25
	=> allies
elif 25 < Stats.faction_opinions.get("knights") and Stats.faction_opinions.get("knights") <= 50
	=> friends
elif 50 < Stats.faction_opinions.get("knights") and Stats.faction_opinions.get("knights") <= 75
	=> reverent
elif Stats.faction_opinions.get("knights") > 75
	=> god



~ allies
Knight: Warrior! Corruption forces press our defenses! Stand with us—we must hold the line together!
~ friends
Knight: Holy guardian! The corrupted masses surge against our walls! Grace us with your presence—help us repel this tide of darkness!
- I will help you.
	Knight: With you on our side, they do not stand a chance.
	do Stats._map_trans_diag_combat()
	=> END
- Deal with it yourslef.
	Knight: No..
	=> END
~ reverent
Knight: Divine protector! Corruption overwhelms our ranks! Descend and drive back these vile forces—only you can save us!
~ god
Knight: Most merciful deity! Your faithful knights are drowning in corruption's tide! We prostrate ourselves before you—smite our enemies and deliver your servants from annihilation!

~ done
Knight: Thank you mighty being for your help.
Knight: We shall remember this.
=> END

~ combat
Knight: Divine protector, smite these unholy beings and rid us of their existence
=> END